    "detailed_description": "<h1>Feature List</h1><p></p><br><h1>About the Game</h1><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3028280/extras/b02788b1d4f104d51e3ef26370292180.poster.avif?t=1722267758\" width=600 height=150 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3028280/extras/b02788b1d4f104d51e3ef26370292180.webm?t=1722267758\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3028280/extras/b02788b1d4f104d51e3ef26370292180.mp4?t=1722267758\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br><strong>Drag and Drop Medieval</strong> is a captivating puzzle game set in a medieval world, where your main task is to move characters using your mouse. It may sound simple, but the game offers over 20 intricately designed levels, each with its own unique challenges and mechanics. Enjoy the charming pixel art graphics as you navigate through puzzles and uncover the secrets of this medieval realm.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3028280/extras/5b7a903f6bdc4f384a3882b0fda48c5d.poster.avif?t=1722267758\" width=600 height=274 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3028280/extras/5b7a903f6bdc4f384a3882b0fda48c5d.webm?t=1722267758\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3028280/extras/5b7a903f6bdc4f384a3882b0fda48c5d.mp4?t=1722267758\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br><strong><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Key Features:</h2></strong><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Engaging Gameplay with Intuitive Drag-and-Drop Mechanics:</h2></strong> Simple yet captivating gameplay where you move medieval characters with your mouse. Strategic thinking turns each move into a brain-teasing challenge.<br></li><li><strong><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Over 20 Challenging Levels with Unique Puzzles:</h2></strong> Navigate through more than 20 levels, each with distinct puzzles that test your problem-solving skills and keep you entertained.<br></li><li><strong><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Charming Pixel Art Graphics:</h2></strong> Enjoy visually appealing pixel art that brings the medieval world to life, enhancing the game's nostalgic and immersive atmosphere.<br></li><li><strong><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >More than 10 Distinct Game Mechanics:</h2></strong> Master a variety of mechanics, from moving obstacles to unlocking pathways, each adding new complexity and fun.<br></li><li><strong><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Unlock 5 Secret Achievements:</h2></strong> Discover hidden secrets and unlock 5 achievements, rewarding your ingenuity and persistence as you solve the game's mysteries.</li></ul><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3028280/extras/78cd0edfa47ed283972a2850c2aa97cb.poster.avif?t=1722267758\" width=600 height=150 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3028280/extras/78cd0edfa47ed283972a2850c2aa97cb.webm?t=1722267758\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3028280/extras/78cd0edfa47ed283972a2850c2aa97cb.mp4?t=1722267758\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span>",
